      "review": "The exact MT parser accepts five bytes: address mode, uint16 destination, duration and TCSignificance. This finite profile fixes mode 2 and local coordinator address 0, explicitly accepts duration 0..254 and significance 0 or 1. The SDK receiver ignores TCSignificance per its R21 comment and clamps duration 255 to 254; the host refuses 255 rather than relying on coercion. The command suppresses a synchronous local change indication while its call is active; later local changes can still be indicated. Management response carries source/status without duration or transaction; local indication carries duration only. Neither is correlated to an opening/closing request. The generic MT send path is excluded; the pinned ZDP_SendData source does not return its declared afStatus_t. DEV_ZB_COORD is enum value 9. No SDK source is redistributed and no complete Zigbee core conformance is claimed."
    }
